      "creatureType": "construct",
      "blurb": "Bakuton: Clay Spider",
      "biography": "<p><em>Explosion Release: Clay Spiders (Bakuton Hijutsu).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus or Save DC when an effect calls for it. You command it as an Action or Bonus action.</p><p><strong>Armor Class</strong> 10 + your ninjutsu ability modifier · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 10 + 10 for every rank above C-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 30 ft.</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +0 (save +3), DEX +0 (+3), CON +0 (+3), INT −5, WIS +0, CHA −5. <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Acid, Poison, Psychic. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, All Sensory, Stunned, Exhaustion. <strong>Senses</strong> Relies on Caster senses.</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Stealth.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> its AC (base + your Ninjutsu ability modifier), hit points (by the rank you cast the jutsu at), Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC, and your senses.</p>",
      "summonRole": "Clay Spider"
