      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The Spider detonates, filling a 5-foot radius. All creatures in the radius takes force damage on a failed Dexterity saving throw or half as much on a success based on the rank the Spider(s) were summoned at. A creature the spider is grabbing makes their save at disadvantage. If more than one spider is Detonating and the same creature is within more than 1 radius, they make a single saving throw, but increase the damage they take by +2d6 for each Clay Spider explosion radius they are in. D-Rank/C-Rank: 3d6. B-Rank/A-Rank: 4d6. S-Rank: 5d6.</p>",
